Hi Justine,

Looks like you have no metadata with your SNP genotypes. You genlight object has

@other: a list containing: elements without names

when it should have something like

@other: a list containing: loc.metrics  latlong  ind.metrics.

Did you generate your genlight object with data from DArT or from some other source?

A

